abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.5.1 is a backward-compatible patch release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It strengthens production-signing guidance, host-enforcement conformance evidence, and package dependency validation without changing public APIs, package dependencies, durable schemas, canonical wire values, package IDs, the net10.0 target, or AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0."
